{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"智利","country_iso":"CHL","created_at":"2026-03-23T09:49:20.344769","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"CHL-HB-0003","ldc":"No","location":"安托法加斯塔区","location_norm":"安托法加斯塔大区","name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"智利杜恩普拉斯186MW光伏+2GWh储能项目","project_name_en":"Chile 186MW PV + 2GWh BESS Project (Tocopilla)","subcategory":"光储"},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"电建国际","content":"当地时间6月27日，中国电建与业主智利GM大都会电力公司正式签订智利杜恩普拉斯光储项目EPC总承包合同。\n该项目位于智利北部的安托法加斯塔区Maria Elena市，距首都圣地亚哥1300公里，紧邻中国电建已顺利交付的智利CEME1光伏项目。项目工作内容包括一座186兆瓦光伏和2吉瓦时储能电站的设计、采购、供货、安装、施工和调试等工作。项目建成后，预计可削减电网年弃电量达682吉瓦时，将有效缓解智利电网高峰期的负荷压力，提升电网稳定性。\n该项目是中国电建与智利GM大都会电力公司达成的第二个EPC项目合作。通过CEME1光伏项目的合作，双方建立了良好的互信。杜恩普拉斯光储项目将是智利已建和在建的单体最大的储能项目，中国电建将充分发挥自身技术和管理优势，科学管理、精心组织，扎实推进各项工作，确保项目高质量履约。该项目的签约和成功实施，将为中国电建在智利及美洲区域市场的高质量发展注入强劲动力。","content_sha256":"9520351aeb9d84b16cc2909e0baf73de4734b20b8a6a0b2b3d78b21fb61d4771","id":3023,"publish_date":"2025-06-30 17:59:03","title":"中国电建签约智利杜恩普拉斯光储项目","title_sha256":"8700b07c659d6c1bafbc23e4779aa00b750cfb61aebf5cf62a025f8f81db100e","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/84604.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"CHL-HB-0003","capacity_details":"PV: 186MW, BESS: 2000MWh","capacity_mw":186.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"186","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T09:49:20.344824","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"CHL-HB-0003-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[\"https://finance.sina.com.cn/stock/relnews/cn/2025-07-01/doc-infcxncv5693919.shtml\"]","official_website_links":"[]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"智利GM大都会电力公司","p